//! The UI layer of compose-rs, as Compose's `androidx.compose.ui`: layout nodes with chains of
//! modifier nodes, measure and place with constraints, a draw pass recording a display list,
//! pointer and key input, focus, and semantics (docs/06-ui.md). It knows no platform: hosts
//! give it a size, a density, a text measurer and events, and replay its display list.

#![forbid(unsafe_code)]

